Output profile.gif

Set Shell "powershell"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 900
Set Height 450
Set FontFamily "Fira Code"
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Padding 20

Type "echo 'Welcome to aryanOS v2.0 - Starting user session...'"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "echo 'Aryan Kumar (B.Tech CS 2029)'"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "Get-Content profile.txt"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "echo 'Research & Math: Linear Algebra, Optimization, Calculus'"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "echo 'Programming: Python, PyTorch, C, Node.js'"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "echo 'QUOTE: C makes it easy to shoot yourself in the foot; C++ makes it harder, but when you do, it blows your whole leg off.'"
Enter
Sleep 4s
